# text.png, rendered by the stock engine's flutter_tester with Impeller,
# against fl-engine's frame through emblema, both at DPR 2. Percent of
# pixels allowed to differ in any channel, and by more than 32.
#
# Layout matches (the metrics program holds it to the stock engine's
# numbers). Glyphs are placed as Impeller places them, on a quarter pixel
# across, hinted; what is left is the rasterizer: Skia's slight hinting
# and coverage against skrifa's hinting and swash's, about 3 percent more
# ink. Outlines (the 160 px glyphs, past the atlas) and the icons agree.
# Measured 2026-11-01, lavapipe: 2.722% differ, 0.389% by more than 32;
# unhinted on whole pixels it was 3.132% and 1.365%.
differ 3.5
differ_over_32 0.6
